Package: m6APrediction
Title: m6A Sites Prediction Using Random Forest
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: 
    person("Jiayin", "Zhong", , "2119901427@qq.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Predicts RNA N6-methyladenosine (m6A) sites using
    a trained random forest classification model. The package
    provides functions for DNA sequence encoding and for
    predicting m6A probabilities and classification statuses
    for single or multiple samples.
